    "Connected sources are resolved through Real-Debrid. Cached torrents start immediately; uncached ones are prepared by Real-Debrid first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las fuentes conectadas se resuelven a través de Real-Debrid. Los torrents en caché se inician al instante; los que no están en caché los prepara Real-Debrid primero."
